<h2>The Solution</h2>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Bringing BoomTV to the Arcade</p>
  <p>
    I transformed the year-in-review concept into a fully immersive 3D arcade
    world: a neon-lit, 90s-inspired space that visually represents the energy
    and excitement of BoomTV’s biggest events.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Experimenting with New Techniques</p>
  <p>
    I pushed my art direction and animation skills with a custom-built Blender
    environment, blending stylized 3D with hand-drawn Grease Pencil animation.
  </p>
</div>
